^XMB(3.9,146084,2,2632,0)="SDES2RECLLREQ ; ALB/TJB,TJB,JDJ,JAS,JDJ,JAS,MCB - VISTA SCHEDULING CREATE/UPDATE RECALL REQUESTS ; AUGUST 13, 2025"
