^XMB(3.9,146100,2,542,0)=" ....I SSNV'=$G(ARAY2(2,.0907)) S RGER=$S($G(RGER)'="""":$G(RGER)_REP,1:""-1^"")_""SSN VERIFICATION field failure"""
